,{"kind":"h2h","stat":"shots_on_target","side":"home","factor":0.987,"effect_pct":-1.1,"measured_pct":-0.5,"detail":"6 past meetings (minor factor)","status":"measured"},{"kind":"h2h","stat":"shots_on_target","side":"away","factor":1.038,"effect_pct":3.1,"measured_pct":1.5,"detail":"6 past meetings (minor factor)","status":"measured"}],"sample":{"home_games":51,"away_games":52,"home_all":103,"away_all":102},"basis":{"min_games":51,"team_news":true},"h2h":[{"date":"2026-03-14","home":"148","away":"147","score":[2,3]},{"date":"2025-09-13","home":"147","away":"148","score":[3,5]},{"date":"2025-02-01","home":"147","away":"148","score":[3,3]},{"date":"2024-09-14","home":"148","away":"147","score":[2,0]},{"date":"2024-03-30","home":"147","away":"148","score":[3,1]},{"date":"2023-09-16","home":"148","away":"147","score":[4,0]}],"analyst_view":{"overall":"Mid-table NEC (11th, 14 points) host leaders PSV (26 points) in the first game after the international break; PSV need a win to stay top, NEC won their last game 3-2 at Utrecht and have beaten PSV in two of the last four meetings. NEC's defence is the story: Perr Schuurs, Bram Nuytinck and Emre Mor are out (the numbers count them), but Philippe Sandler has had a setback and Deveron Fonville came back from Curacao with a knock and is doubtful, which the numbers do not know. PSV came through the break almost fully fit: Sergino Dest is a doubt after leaving the US camp early (NOS, 20 Nov), Paul Wanner is close but not expected to start, Ivan Perisic is back, and Ouaissa, Nagalo, Schouten and Plea are out (mostly counted). Referee Jeroen Manschot's above-average card rate is already in the numbers.","goals":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":5,"call":"Around 4.1 goals","text":"The numbers say 3.9 goals, already including NEC's hot scoring run (14 in six), a cut for Schuurs, small cuts for Mor, Geiger, Wanner and Plea, and a little for the high-scoring head-to-head. What they can't see is that NEC are also without centre-back Sandler and may lose Fonville, leaving a patched back line against PSV's league-best attack, with Perisic back; I keep +5%, about 4.1."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.0 corners, with NEC's recent corner surge (+2%) and PSV's quieter spell (-5%) already counted. Dest, one of PSV's main crossers from full-back, is still a doubt, but Kostic and the returning Perisic give width either way and both sides play open, attacking football, so I stay at 10.0."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 3.9 cards","text":"The numbers say 3.9 cards, already pushed up about 18% for referee Jeroen Manschot (3.5 cards a game in 51 games). A makeshift NEC defence may have to foul more against PSV's runners, but no suspensions hang over either side and there is no special needle between the clubs, so I stay at 3.9."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 29 shots","text":"The numbers say 29.4 shots, with NEC's heavy recent shooting (116 in six, +10%) already counted. Both teams like to attack and PSV's front line is close to full strength, which is what the numbers assume, so I stay at about 29.4."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":3,"call":"Around 11.3 on target","text":"The numbers say 11.0 shots on target, with NEC's sharper recent finishing already in. With Sandler out on top of the counted Schuurs and Nuytinck, and Fonville doubtful, NEC's back line is weaker than the numbers think and PSV should get more clean shots away; a mild +3% to about 11.3."},"sources":["https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/nec/preview/nijmegen-vs-psv-prediction-team-news-lineups_609357.html","https://www.voetbalnieuws.nl/nieuws/2160861/nec-kampt-met-defensieve-zorgen-terugslag-sandler-fonville-vraagteken-vn.html","https://www.voetbalprimeur.nl/nieuws/2161029/vermoedelijke-opstelling-psv-tegen-nec.html","https://nos.nl/liveblog/2640270-dest-nog-onzeker-bij-psv-voor-uitduel-met-nec-courtois-verlengt-bij-rea